WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.157 --> 00:00:17.638
Roxy looked she saw blobs.

2
00:00:18.599 --> 00:00:19.820
They oozed on buildings.

3
00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.001
They covered cars.

4
00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.263
"This is terrible!"

5
00:00:24.403 --> 00:00:25.123
thought Roxy.

6
00:00:26.024 --> 00:00:27.585
A helicopter flew over Mara.

7
00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:31.748
One small blob jumped toward it.

8
00:00:32.748 --> 00:00:34.969
But the blob froze and fell to the rooftop.

9
00:00:37.589 --> 00:00:38.910
"Wow!" said Mara.

10
00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:43.131
"I think the cold breeze from the helicopter froze that blob!"

11
00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:47.752
Mara looked at Roxy.

12
00:00:49.293 --> 00:00:50.013
"Rocket Girl!"

13
00:00:50.213 --> 00:00:50.753
she called.

14
00:00:51.893 --> 00:00:53.094
"Use your super breath!

15
00:00:54.214 --> 00:00:55.714
It will freeze the blobs!"

16
00:00:57.215 --> 00:00:58.035
"I'll try it!"

17
00:00:58.235 --> 00:00:59.075
Roxy called back.

18
00:01:00.116 --> 00:01:01.216
Roxy took a deep breath.

19
00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:06.562
Whoosh! Three blobs on a billboard froze and fell to the street.

20
00:01:07.722 --> 00:01:09.363
"Yes!" Roxy cheered.

21
00:01:10.324 --> 00:01:12.064
She took a deeper breath and blew again.

22
00:01:12.084 --> 00:01:16.186
Whoo-ooo-oosh! More blobs froze.

23
00:01:17.247 --> 00:01:19.247
Soon every blob was frozen solid.

24
00:01:22.869 --> 00:01:24.690
Mrs. Wiggles was in her candy factory.

25
00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:29.312
"Soon I'll call Mayor Bloom," she said.

26
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:35.001
"I'll tell him to pay me one million dollars!"

27
00:01:35.982 --> 00:01:38.983
Mrs. Wiggles peered through a telescope at downtown Metro City.

28
00:01:41.263 --> 00:01:42.103
"Oh no!"

29
00:01:42.444 --> 00:01:43.044
she cried.

30
00:01:43.064 --> 00:01:46.445
"Where did my bubble gum blob go?"

31
00:01:47.445 --> 00:01:49.846
Just then Roxy crashed into the candy factory.

32
00:01:49.866 --> 00:01:52.606
"Rocket Girl!"

33
00:01:53.027 --> 00:01:53.447
said Mrs.

34
00:01:53.507 --> 00:01:56.748
Wiggles. "I stopped your bubble gum blob!"

35
00:01:56.948 --> 00:01:57.588
said Roxy.

36
00:01:58.728 --> 00:02:00.769
"And now you're going to jail!"

37
00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.191
Mrs. Wiggles snapped her fingers.

38
00:02:04.531 --> 00:02:06.713
Several large gingerbread men ran into the room.

39
00:02:07.773 --> 00:02:10.715
Mrs. Wiggles laughed.

40
00:02:10.735 --> 00:02:13.397
"You'll never take me to jail!"

41
00:02:14.657 --> 00:02:16.218
Roxy looked at the gingerbread men.

42
00:02:17.079 --> 00:02:18.519
They were big and mean looking.

43
00:02:18.539 --> 00:02:21.681
"I'll be right back," said Roxy.

44
00:02:21.701 --> 00:02:23.682
"I forgot something."

45
00:02:24.903 --> 00:02:26.204
Roxy flew out of the building.

46
00:02:27.284 --> 00:02:29.305
Mrs. Wiggles laughed.

47
00:02:29.806 --> 00:02:32.908
"Rocket Girl is scared of—" Splat!

48
00:02:33.668 --> 00:02:35.410
A small blob hit a gingerbread man.

49
00:02:36.851 --> 00:02:38.672
The gingerbread man smashed into pieces.

50
00:02:38.692 --> 00:02:41.914
"What's going on?"

51
00:02:42.134 --> 00:02:43.135
Mrs. Wiggles cried.

52
00:02:44.256 --> 00:02:45.496
Splat! Splat!

53
00:02:45.817 --> 00:02:50.200
Splat! Roxy threw blobs at every gingerbread man.

54
00:02:53.042 --> 00:02:55.163
Soon all the gingerbread men were smashed.

55
00:02:57.368 --> 00:02:57.869
"No!" cried Mrs.

56
00:02:57.909 --> 00:03:01.011
Wiggles. Roxy took Mrs.

57
00:03:01.051 --> 00:03:01.812
Wiggles to jail.

58
00:03:03.974 --> 00:03:05.375
Then she flew back to Mara.

59
00:03:05.395 --> 00:03:08.838
"Thanks for your help," said Roxy.

60
00:03:08.858 --> 00:03:12.441
"My friends are at Metro City Park," said Mara.

61
00:03:12.461 --> 00:03:14.382
"Can you take me there?"

62
00:03:15.343 --> 00:03:16.184
Roxy smiled.

63
00:03:16.204 --> 00:03:19.187
"Sure. Rocket Girl can do that!"

64
00:03:22.389 --> 00:03:25.392
A little while later, Roxy was out of her Rocket Girl costume.

65
00:03:26.344 --> 00:03:27.625
She found her friends at the park.

66
00:03:30.187 --> 00:03:31.048
"Hey, Roxy!"

67
00:03:31.288 --> 00:03:33.770
called Terrell."Mara is here!

68
00:03:34.691 --> 00:03:35.712
Guess who found her."

69
00:03:35.732 --> 00:03:38.074
"Who?" asked Roxy.

70
00:03:38.094 --> 00:03:39.755
"Rocket Girl!"

71
00:03:39.976 --> 00:03:40.636
said Mara.

72
00:03:40.656 --> 00:03:44.119
"She saved me from a giant bubble gum blob!"

73
00:03:44.139 --> 00:03:47.062
"Wow," said Roxy.

74
00:03:47.082 --> 00:03:50.585
"I can't believe I missed Rocket Girl."

75
00:03:52.226 --> 00:03:54.448
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

76
00:03:55.641 --> 00:03:56.723
"Let's play kickball!"

77
00:03:56.904 --> 00:03:57.585
said Jack.

78
00:04:02.335 --> 00:04:04.619
Roxy and her friends ran onto the field.
